WEBVTT

0:00:09.000 --> 0:00:15.270
A thousand million years ago, in one galactic dimension lived…

0:00:15.600 --> 0:00:16.520
Fёdor.

0:00:16.520 --> 0:00:26.900
One day, a mysterious witch gave him magical playing cards that he could use to summon mighty clones!

0:00:27.560 --> 0:00:31.810
And each one of them possessed tremendous power!

0:00:32.560 --> 0:00:33.810
Except for Brolly.

0:00:33.810 --> 0:00:35.600
And Kuromaku.

0:00:35.940 --> 0:00:36.730
And Spade too.

0:00:37.020 --> 0:00:42.700
You know, now that I think about it, only one of them had powers - THE INVINCIBLE WARU!

0:00:42.700 --> 0:00:48.312
He created a great kingdom for himself, called Waruland!

0:00:48.604 --> 0:00:52.190
And it was a lot cooler than the others’.

0:00:52.480 --> 0:00:54.600
Everyone wanted to get in there…

0:00:55.100 --> 0:00:57.399
…only ‘cause you’re hogging the toilet.

0:00:57.690 --> 0:00:58.730
Exactly!

0:00:58.730 --> 0:01:01.270
And that’s how I gained unlimited power.

0:01:01.650 --> 0:01:04.190
Remind me, why did we give him the bathroom?

0:01:04.190 --> 0:01:07.950
We thought it’d be funny. It was meant to be a punishment…

0:01:08.190 --> 0:01:13.230
And who’s laughing now? Who’s really been punished?

0:01:13.230 --> 0:01:14.690
What the..!?

0:01:16.230 --> 0:01:17.730
What have you done?!

0:01:17.850 --> 0:01:19.729
We came up with a genius idea!

0:01:20.810 --> 0:01:21.649
Again?

0:01:21.940 --> 0:01:23.730
We divided up the apartment!

0:01:23.730 --> 0:01:24.900
MY apartment?

0:01:25.270 --> 0:01:26.689
We left your room untouched.

0:01:26.900 --> 0:01:28.690
Hmm... Thank you.

0:01:28.690 --> 0:01:29.520
You’re welcome!

0:01:31.230 --> 0:01:33.100
What did you do!?

0:01:33.440 --> 0:01:38.500
When you’re too busy setting up boundaries, you miss out on endless possibilities...

0:01:38.500 --> 0:01:40.500
No, not you! The sofa!

0:01:41.190 --> 0:01:43.980
Kuromaku, why didn’t you do anythi-...

0:01:44.600 --> 0:01:46.560
…nevermind, I’ll sort it out.

0:01:50.440 --> 0:01:52.600
Greetings, traveler! Come on in.

0:01:53.100 --> 0:01:55.600
Have a taste of my sweet fruit.

0:01:55.604 --> 0:01:56.649
Eughhh!

0:01:57.100 --> 0:01:58.020
Hey!

0:01:58.980 --> 0:02:00.480
And what are YOU doing?!

0:02:00.730 --> 0:02:03.270
Barricading against the "kingdom of Felix".

0:02:06.020 --> 0:02:08.800
Don’t be so dramatic! Where did you get those planks from?

0:02:08.800 --> 0:02:10.190
Brolly lent me some.

0:02:14.500 --> 0:02:16.690
Ugh, get in here! What’s the matter with you all!?

0:02:18.650 --> 0:02:20.480
Fedya, Fedya, look, it’s done!

0:02:20.480 --> 0:02:24.310
See here, that’s a farm, and here’s a bank, and over there are the hospitals!

0:02:24.850 --> 0:02:27.300
You know, that is kinda cute...

0:02:27.300 --> 0:02:28.230
IS THAT A COCKROACH?!

0:02:28.730 --> 0:02:30.650
That’s a little resident of Felicia!

0:02:30.650 --> 0:02:32.150
Vitalik!

0:02:34.500 --> 0:02:36.270
Ha! Don’t be so dramatic!

0:02:38.850 --> 0:02:40.270
My country!..

0:02:40.980 --> 0:02:43.230
THAT IS IT!!!

0:02:44.100 --> 0:02:47.310
I summoned you to… help me out!

0:02:47.650 --> 0:02:48.599
But you!..

0:02:48.600 --> 0:02:50.990
You all do the opposite!

0:02:53.000 --> 0:02:54.190
OK, I’m calm…

0:02:54.600 --> 0:02:55.770
LISTEN UP!

0:02:56.150 --> 0:03:01.230
If you don’t clean up your mess, I’ll send you all…

0:03:01.520 --> 0:03:03.060
Yes, I’ll send you!

0:03:03.310 --> 0:03:04.480
Back to!

0:03:04.730 --> 0:03:06.019
The card!

0:03:06.310 --> 0:03:07.020
WORLD!

0:03:07.020 --> 0:03:07.850
[GASP]

0:03:08.400 --> 0:03:09.189
Get off!

0:03:09.850 --> 0:03:12.310
You have until I get back from the store.

0:03:12.310 --> 0:03:13.770
But you just came from there.

0:03:13.770 --> 0:03:15.770
I’m getting supplies.

0:03:16.150 --> 0:03:17.150
…for the pests.

0:03:17.560 --> 0:03:19.150
He means you guys.

0:03:23.270 --> 0:03:23.850
Aww…

0:03:24.100 --> 0:03:25.690
You must be so sad.

0:03:25.850 --> 0:03:26.400
Yeah.

0:03:26.650 --> 0:03:30.230
Don’t worry, cockroaches don’t live longer than 6 months anyway.

0:03:30.690 --> 0:03:32.060
What? WARU!

0:03:32.560 --> 0:03:35.349
Stop horsing around, we don’t have much time.

0:03:35.600 --> 0:03:38.604
Time is but a relative mode of being to…

0:03:38.800 --> 0:03:40.560
That includes your quotes, Dante.

0:03:40.560 --> 0:03:45.730
Divide the responsibilities between you, while me and Brolly, since we had nothing to do with this mess,

0:03:45.730 --> 0:03:47.269
tidy up Fёdor’s room.

0:03:49.310 --> 0:03:50.980
Welp, let’s get to it!

0:03:52.040 --> 0:03:54.519
Spade! Would you fix the balcony?

0:03:54.520 --> 0:03:55.350
Nope.

0:03:55.560 --> 0:03:57.060
How about taking your wall down?

0:03:57.440 --> 0:03:58.190
Nope.

0:03:58.190 --> 0:04:00.190
As in you can’t, or don’t want to?

0:04:00.400 --> 0:04:01.000
Nope.

0:04:01.190 --> 0:04:02.350
…You're a fat antelope!

0:04:03.350 --> 0:04:06.190
Fёdor is threatening and manipulating us.

0:04:06.190 --> 0:04:08.980
Didn’t you threaten him with a knife recently?

0:04:09.060 --> 0:04:10.150
THAT’S DIFFERENT!

0:04:10.150 --> 0:04:12.937
I’d rather live in squalor than take orders.

0:04:13.000 --> 0:04:13.810
Done!

0:04:16.480 --> 0:04:18.480
I just took the trash out. 

0:04:18.480 --> 0:04:21.540
Aha! You obeyed Fёdor.

0:04:26.200 --> 0:04:28.440
Don’t you want to wash your own clothes?

0:04:28.440 --> 0:04:32.450
The only thing that can be clean is, uh… your soul.

0:04:32.690 --> 0:04:35.310
Dante, socks can also be clean, y’know.

0:04:39.700 --> 0:04:41.646
Romeo! There’s still space in there!

0:04:41.800 --> 0:04:42.560
Nah-ha-huh.

0:04:42.560 --> 0:04:44.560
You can’t mix clothes with blankets.

0:04:44.560 --> 0:04:47.690
Why not? I’ll run the mixed cycle.

0:04:47.690 --> 0:04:49.500
Felix, that’s not how it works.

0:04:49.500 --> 0:04:52.650
Fine, fine. I just wanted to save us some time.

0:05:02.190 --> 0:05:04.100
That’s… not meant to happen!

0:05:04.100 --> 0:05:07.520
I think I messed up… Really messed up...

0:05:07.850 --> 0:05:09.350
Nunquam errat…

0:05:26.200 --> 0:05:27.500
I’m losing my mind…

0:05:44.400 --> 0:05:47.440
Do you think we did the right thing, leaving them alone?

0:05:47.600 --> 0:05:48.980
No need to worry.

0:05:49.200 --> 0:05:52.500
Surely it can’t get any worse than- ugh! That train wreck.

0:05:53.190 --> 0:05:54.020
Ah-huh…

0:05:55.100 --> 0:05:58.060
Not like they could wipe the apartment off the face of the Earth.

0:05:58.730 --> 0:05:59.730
Mhmm...

0:06:05.689 --> 0:06:08.060
Maybe I’m… seeing things…

0:06:10.350 --> 0:06:11.480
Or maybe not.

0:06:12.850 --> 0:06:13.810
I’m free!

0:06:16.730 --> 0:06:17.560
A wall!

0:06:17.810 --> 0:06:19.900
An impenetrable wall!

0:06:20.500 --> 0:06:21.900
Wait a minute...

0:06:36.980 --> 0:06:37.730
AAAH!

0:06:37.730 --> 0:06:39.500
Something touched me!

0:06:41.440 --> 0:06:43.350
…qui nihil agit.

0:06:43.810 --> 0:06:44.350
What?..

0:06:44.650 --> 0:06:46.350
Where did the bubbles come from?

0:06:46.690 --> 0:06:47.810
I’ll tell you!

0:06:48.190 --> 0:06:51.440
Waru swapped laundry detergent with a bath foam!

0:06:51.800 --> 0:06:54.979
[SINISTER LAUGHTER]

0:06:55.150 --> 0:07:01.400
Behold! The era of my great Green Kingdom has begun!

0:07:01.400 --> 0:07:01.979
It’s white.

0:07:02.400 --> 0:07:03.979
No, it’s green.

0:07:03.980 --> 0:07:05.300
But the bubbles are white.

0:07:07.060 --> 0:07:08.440
Huh! Oh yeah...

0:07:08.980 --> 0:07:12.396
And what do you suggest we do? We don’t have time to clean this up.

0:07:12.604 --> 0:07:14.560
Let’s look at the positives.

0:07:14.560 --> 0:07:17.050
At least the apartment looks clean now.

0:07:17.050 --> 0:07:20.199
We can make new clothes out of bubbles.

0:07:20.200 --> 0:07:21.700
Ew, Romeo!

0:07:21.850 --> 0:07:23.700
What? It was just a suggestion.

0:07:25.440 --> 0:07:26.400
Phew...

0:07:26.690 --> 0:07:28.850
We’ll be sent back to the card world.

0:07:28.850 --> 0:07:31.480
I said POSITIVES!

0:07:31.480 --> 0:07:34.100
B-but it is a positive. It’s safe there…

0:07:34.100 --> 0:07:35.560
NOOOO!

0:07:35.620 --> 0:07:37.060
Fart show!

0:07:37.300 --> 0:07:37.979
O-Ouch!

0:07:43.270 --> 0:07:47.900
“To accept the freedom of others, you first need to become free yourself.”

0:07:51.370 --> 0:07:53.690
It’s noisy up there again!

0:07:53.690 --> 0:07:57.730
Oh, well, it’s temporary, haha. I’ve got a friend staying with me.

0:07:58.400 --> 0:08:01.060
Has your friend got 16 legs?

0:08:01.600 --> 0:08:03.060
[NERVOUS LAUGH]

0:08:03.480 --> 0:08:06.400
And what’s up with that… “soap opera” upstairs?

0:08:06.400 --> 0:08:08.400
Whole hallway is covered!

0:08:08.810 --> 0:08:10.600
Uhm… Un momento!

0:08:21.200 --> 0:08:23.150
You got rid of all the paint!

0:08:23.520 --> 0:08:24.810
And cleaned the sofa!

0:08:25.020 --> 0:08:27.270
And even dusted off the ceiling light!

0:08:28.980 --> 0:08:31.310
You haven’t taken down Spade’s wall, but… Yeah, whatever!

0:08:31.520 --> 0:08:33.099
Ohhh…

0:08:33.310 --> 0:08:34.479
I was wrong about you.

0:08:34.770 --> 0:08:37.300
Come on, let’s have dinner.

0:08:37.770 --> 0:08:40.060
Let me just wash my hands.

0:08:41.310 --> 0:08:41.940
Damn…

0:08:41.940 --> 0:08:43.099
What’s wrong?

0:08:43.200 --> 0:08:44.850
… We didn’t turn off the washer.

0:08:45.480 --> 0:08:46.500
You what!?

0:08:52.000 --> 0:08:52.980
Are you serious?!

0:08:53.310 --> 0:08:54.980
No worries, I got it!

0:08:58.270 --> 0:09:01.560
Oh, well, I guess you could color me surprised.

0:09:01.950 --> 0:09:06.770
[LAUGH]

0:09:11.000 --> 0:09:12.480
He’s… laughing?

0:09:13.440 --> 0:09:15.020
He’s in hysterics!

0:09:15.020 --> 0:09:17.020
Hah! Call an ambulance!

0:09:17.440 --> 0:09:20.900
Guys, haha… You’re terrible.

0:09:21.310 --> 0:09:22.900
Well, we are your clones.

0:09:23.900 --> 0:09:28.850
Well… then I’m no better. Let’s just clean this all up.

0:09:29.690 --> 0:09:30.520
Together.

0:09:34.900 --> 0:09:36.100
Well, bon apple…

0:09:36.150 --> 0:09:36.600
bon…

0:09:36.600 --> 0:09:37.100
apple…

0:09:37.100 --> 0:09:37.810
Whatever!

0:09:37.810 --> 0:09:41.480
Spade, Romeo, Brolly, Waru, Felix, Dante, Kuromaku, Ga-...

0:09:42.730 --> 0:09:44.019
Where’s Gabriel?

0:09:47.350 --> 0:09:51.190
Out of all the twins from that flat, you are the nicest.

0:09:51.190 --> 0:09:53.190
Thank you for your help.

0:09:53.980 --> 0:09:57.399
I mean, Fеdya never specified which apartment needed cleaning.

0:09:59.400 --> 0:10:01.400
Oh, change the channel.

0:10:01.690 --> 0:10:03.400
My favorite TV show is about to start.

0:10:04.900 --> 0:10:10.650
This is the story about how I lost… Everything I had…